    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is not onto</p><p>&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is one-one</p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is one-one but not onto.</p><p>one-one, into</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a30cadf9-43b7-4a4c-9183-9eb3a3d18792-image.png\" style=\"width: 225px; height: 193px;\" /></p>",
